          "copyright": "© ℗ Stone Table Records 2023",
          "description": "Yoto says: A collection of songs specifically chosen to bring a smile to your face. Perfect for car rides, chores, or simply starting your day off on the right foot.\n\nSure to put you in a good mood, and the perfect soundtrack for getting ready for the day, I Dream of You: JOY is a collection of familiar feel-good songs like Do-Re-Mi and The Bare Necessities. Play the album first thing in the morning, or during playtime, rides to school, and other fun daily activities.\n\n\nCard Includes:\n\n\nBeautiful Day\nDo-Re-Mi\nThe Bare Necessities\nRainbow Connection\nDon’t Worry Be Happy / Three Little Birds\nGrand Adventure\nFriday I’m In Love\nI Can See Clearly Now\nA Spoonful Of Sugar\nWildflowers\nSingin’ In The Rain\nAll You Need Is Love\nYoung At Heart\nOrdinary Days\nWhat A Wonderful World\nTomorrow",
